WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
IncidentIQ local demo. Synthetic data.
Sign in as a demo responder.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
Inspect the incident dashboard.

00:16.000 --> 00:28.000
Declare a synthetic payment API timeout.
Attach the initial log evidence.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
The incident record and timeline open.

00:35.000 --> 00:43.000
Acknowledge the incident and add a response note.

00:43.000 --> 00:49.000
Move the incident to Investigating.

00:49.000 --> 01:05.000
Generate and review advisory analysis.
This demo uses the heuristic fallback, without a paid AI key.

01:05.000 --> 01:13.000
The responder resolves the synthetic incident.

01:13.000 --> 01:23.000
Return to the overview. Every transition remains human controlled.
